'''Brine rats''' are [[Slayer monsters]] that can be found in the [[Brine Rat Cavern]] near [[Rellekka]]. They are notable for being the only monsters to drop the [[brine sabre]]. A [[Slayer]] level of 47 is required to fight them.

They are only [[Slayer task|assigned]] to players who have completed [[Olaf's Quest]]. Additionally, they can be killed as an alternative for a [[rat]] [[Slayer task]] provided the player has the appropriate Slayer level to do so.

Killing a brine rat is a requirement for completing the [[Fremennik Diary#Medium|medium]] task set in the [[Fremennik Diary]].

